@segment  descend-f15-f10
@title    Return — Focus 15 down to Focus 10
@levels   F10
@fixed
@duration ~1m40s

say You'll now return from Focus 15 to Focus 12.
pause 4
say Fifteen.
pause 4
level F12
say Fourteen. You're returning to time.
pause 4
say Thirteen. Calmly and comfortably.
pause 4
say Twelve.
pause 5
say You're now back in Focus 12, the state of expanded awareness.
pause 6
say Now return to Focus 10.
pause 3
level F10
say Twelve.
pause 4
say Eleven.
pause 4
say Ten.
pause 5
say You're now in Focus 10.
pause 4
say Mind awake. Body asleep.
pause 6
say Now, express gratitude for all you've perceived, received, and aligned with.
pause 10
